8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T04:53:09-07:00","id":1247666,"title":"","content":"For reference, the other Magic Kingdom lands are:<br /> <br /> <b>Fantasy Land Court</b><br /> <br /> <b>Ruler Title:</b> Prince or Princess<br /> <b>Court Emotion:</b> <br /> <b>Bargain:</b> <br /> <b>Contracts:</b> <br /> <br /> <b>Adventureland Court</b><br /> <br /> <b>Ruler Title:</b> <br /> <b>Court Emotion:</b> Excitement?<br /> <b>Bargain:</b> <br /> <b>Contracts:</b> <br /> <br /> <b>Liberty Square Court</b><br /> <br /> <b>Ruler Title:</b> President<br /> <b>Court Emotion:</b> Nationalism?<br /> <b>Bargain:</b> <br /> <b>Contracts:</b> <br /> <br /> <b>Frontierland Court</b><br /> <br /> <b>Ruler Title:</b> Sheriff?<br /> <b>Court Emotion:</b> <br /> <b>Bargain:</b> <br /> <b>Contracts:</b> <br /> <hr /><br /> If I might propose some court dynamics, how about they each share Freehold control democratically, with the pan-Freehold Mouse Court acting as tiebreaker (if needed)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T22:23:56-07:00","id":1247913,"title":"","content":"And the king who rules it all is a very old Skitterskulk Beast with red trousers who put his fetch in &quot;cryogenic sleep&quot; and is now trying to find a good way to get his public life back as &quot;science revived me&quot;. His Keeper, Chernabog, is amused to see him try.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24237-pluvinarch","name":"Pluvinarch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T22:59:46-07:00","id":1247919,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1246650-walt-disney-world?p=1247666#post1247666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I might propose some court dynamics, how about they each share Freehold control democratically, with the pan-Freehold Mouse Court acting as tiebreaker (if needed)?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say the Main Street Court could do that. It would work as a, relatively speaking, neutral court.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pluvinarch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1246650-walt-disney-world?p=1247913#post1247913\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And the king who rules it all is a very old Skitterskulk Beast with red trousers who put his fetch in &quot;cryogenic sleep&quot; and is now trying to find a good way to get his public life back as &quot;science revived me&quot;. His Keeper, Chernabog, is amused to see him try.</div> </div> </div> </div>...technically the wrong park, since old Uncle Walt is &quot;supposed&quot; to be in the Anaheim park.<br /> <br /> ~Unless if the California park and Florida parks are more literal mirrors of each other then we'd thought~<br /> ----------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> Here's what I can think of for today:<br /> <br /> <b>Fantasyland Court</b><br /> <br /> <b>Ruler Title:</b> Prince or Princess<br /> <b>Court Emotion: </b><i>Wonder</i><br /> <b>Bargain:</b><br /> <b>Contracts: </b><i>Bibibity Boppity Buddies, There Are No Strings on You</i><br /> <br /> <b>Adventureland Court</b><br /> <br /> <b>Ruler Title: </b><i>Skipper</i><br /> <b>Court Emotion:</b> Excitement<br /> <b>Bargain:</b><br /> <b>Contracts: </b><i>Dead Men Do Tell Tales, Down the Backside of Water</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T15:31:39-07:00","id":1248229,"title":"","content":"How would Animal Kingdom and Epcot be organized? Dinosaurs, Asia, Africa, Pandora for AK? Treat the World Showcase as separate Courts, or one opposed to the Future World Court?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T22:53:12-07:00","id":1248330,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1246650-walt-disney-world?p=1248229#post1248229\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How would Animal Kingdom and Epcot be organized? Dinosaurs, Asia, Africa, Pandora for AK? Treat the World Showcase as separate Courts, or one opposed to the Future World Court?</div> </div> </div> </div>For Animal Kingdom it could be that way...however.<br /> <br /> The mission statement of AK has always been to celebrate three categories of animals: the animals of today, the animals of the distant past, and the animals of fiction. So it would be something like:<br /> <br /> <b>Animal Court</b> (<i>Africa + Asia</i>) <b>Court</b><br /> <br /> <b>Dinosaur Court </b><br /> <br /> <b>Pandora Court</b> <br /> <br /> <b>Beastly Court</b> [<i>Lost Court</i>]<br /> <br /> For Epcot...actually I would say it's more like there's two Freeholds in one park.<br /> <br /> The pavilions are big enough with a broad enough concept to deserve their own Courts. That Future World and World Showcase own concepts are big enough to accommodate these concepts. So...<br /> <br /> <u><b>Freehold of the Future</b></u><br /> <br /> Progress (Spaceship Earth?) Court<br /> <br /> Communications Court<br /> <br /> Energy Court<br /> <br /> Motion Court<br /> <br /> The Land Court<br /> <br /> The Seas Court<br /> <br /> Space Court<br /> <br /> Imagination Court<br /> <br /> <u><b>Freehold of the World </b></u><br /> <br /> Court of the USA<br /> <br /> Court of Japan<br /> <br /> Court of Morocco<br /> <br /> Court of France<br /> <br /> Court of the UK<br /> <br /> Court of Canada<br /> <br /> Court of Mexico<br /> <br /> Court of Norway<br /> <br /> Court of China<br /> <br /> Court of Germany<br /> <br /> Court of Italy","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-21T21:58:56-07:00","id":1248619,"title":"","content":"Now finishing up the rest of the Magic Kingdom courts (minus their Bargains for now)<br /> <br /> <b>Liberty Square Court</b><br /> <br /> <b>Ruler Title:</b> President<br /> <b>Court Emotion:</b> <i>Pride</i><br /> <b>Bargain:</b><br /> <b>Contracts: </b><i>Self-Evident Truths, Grim Grinning Ghosts</i><br /> <br /> <b>Frontierland Court</b><br /> <br /> <b>Ruler Title:</b> Sheriff<br /> <b>Court Emotion:</b> <i>Daring</i><br /> <b>Bargain:</b><br /> <b>Contracts: </b><i>Laughin' Place</i>, <i>Big Thunder Charge, Beary Jamboree</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-22T04:14:26-07:00","id":1248676,"title":"","content":"Hmm. Actually, for Epcot, what if instead of Courts for the World Showcase, it was instead a major Trod Nexus (leading to the various places represented)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-25T11:15:43-07:00","id":1248877,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:arial\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1246650-walt-disney-world?p=1248676#post1248676\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm. Actually, for Epcot, what if instead of Courts for the World Showcase, it was instead a major Trod Nexus (leading to the various places represented)?</div> </div> </div> </div>How about both?</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\">Like, the idea behind the World Showcase pavilions is that they're, as one YTer put it, &quot;Nations in 5 Seconds&quot;. To do a micro-overview (approved by Disney) of each nation. So I think these Courts being microcosms of the nation's myths and fae could still work...in addition to having the trods lead to the nations they represent.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 08-25-2018, 02:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-25T16:23:48-07:00","id":1248893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1246650-walt-disney-world?p=1248877#post1248877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><br /> How about both?</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\">Like, the idea behind the World Showcase pavilions is that they're, as one YTer put it, &quot;Nations in 5 Seconds&quot;. To do a micro-overview (approved by Disney) of each nation. So I think these Courts being microcosms of the nation's myths and fae could still work...in addition to having the trods lead to the nations they represent.</span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sure. That's just <i>another</i> 12 Courts to write up, though. :-P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-29T00:40:06-07:00","id":1249637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1246650-walt-disney-world?p=1248893#post1248893\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sure. That's just <i>another</i> 12 Courts to write up, though. :-P</div> </div> </div> </div><i>~We'll be FINE!!!~ </i><br /> <br /> Bargain time now.<br /> <br /> <i>Main Street USA Court Bargain:</i><br /> <br /> The fae must make the changelings feel at home. More specifically, of the home they no longer have. So much so that they wish that they had their old life back. Be it the tune from that ear-worm of a Top 100, the school dance when they shared their first kiss, or that one trip to the beach when you laughed as your older brother wiped out when he tried to surf.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-29T03:14:28-07:00","id":1249656,"title":"","content":"Edit: Wrong thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-29T06:20:57-07:00","id":1249683,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1246650-walt-disney-world?p=1249637#post1249637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <i>~We'll be FINE!!!~ </i><br /> <br /> Bargain time now.<br /> <br /> <i>Main Street USA Court Bargain:</i><br /> <br /> The fae must make the changelings feel at home. More specifically, of the home they no longer have. So much so that they wish that they had their old life back. Be it the tune from that ear-worm of a Top 100, the school dance when they shared their first kiss, or that one trip to the beach when you laughed as your older brother wiped out when he tried to surf.</div> </div> </div> </div>Technically &quot;Wreck It Ralph 2&quot; will have a feeling like this. Sure, it is a shameless ad in movie format to make kids visit the Disney website. But apart from that it will show the many different themed worlds they have: princesses, stormtroopers, etc, away from their main &quot;home&quot; and interacting with each other.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24237-pluvinarch","name":"Pluvinarch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}